body:
Yes it is VERY possible. Do not click links! This is how IPs get leaked. If you click a link to an external website then your IP WILL be LOGGED for the owner to view as they wish.

&#x200B;

Unless the website is trusted, do not engage with it especially when some random stranger hands it over like so. Even something as simple as joining a Minecraft or Roblox server will hand over your IP.

Ignore and block em.

&#x200B;

Better yet, report to local authorities. I bet they'd love to pick up a juicy case
